.TH git-graft 1  "git-graft 0.1.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
git\-graft \- Copy\-on\-write Git workspaces for people and coding agents
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit\-graft\fR [\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copy\-on\-write Git workspaces for people and coding agents
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<REPO>\fR [default: .]
Git checkout or subdirectory to manage
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print compact JSON (the default is indented JSON)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBmcp\fR
Serve the local repository over MCP on stdin/stdout
.TP
\fBspawn\fR
Create an independent repository from a local commit
.TP
\fBlist\fR
Show active and recoverable independent repositories
.TP
\fBstatus\fR
Inspect the workspace, including its current HEAD and files
.TP
\fBdoctor\fR
Check local Git and source\-sharing capabilities
.TP
\fBheartbeat\fR
Renew the workspace lease
.TP
\fBenv\fR
Show this workspace's runtime and cache paths
.TP
\fBexec\fR
Execute a program in the workspace
.TP
\fBregister\-manager\fR
Register a package manager for cache and dependency reuse
.TP
\fBlist\-managers\fR
List registered package managers
.TP
\fBunregister\-manager\fR
Remove a registered package manager
.TP
\fBadd\-dep\fR
Add dependencies or perform a locked install
.TP
\fBseed\-layer\fR
Seed installed dependencies from the primary checkout
.TP
\fBlayer\fR
Save, restore or forget an installed dependency layer
.TP
\fBland\fR
Transfer committed work to a local branch and archive the repository
.TP
\fBdrop\fR
Archive the complete independent repository and its files
.TP
\fBrestore\fR
Reopen an archived repository
.TP
\fBundo\-land\fR
Append a reversal commit to the exact landed destination
.TP
\fBlock\fR
Protect against moves, retirement and cleanup
.TP
\fBunlock\fR
Release an explicit workspace lock
.TP
\fBmove\fR
Move a workspace to an available path on its volume
.TP
\fBrepair\fR
Reconnect a workspace that was moved using the filesystem
.TP
\fBgc\fR
Preview or archive eligible expired workspaces
.PP
Run \fBgit graft\fR \fICOMMAND\fR \fB\-\-help\fR for a command's options.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgit\-worktree\fR(1), https://github.com/mprync/git\-graft
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
